":"3768760","steamName":"007 First Light","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3768760/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:06:43.894521+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Earn the Number. 007 First Light is a thrilling espionage action-adventure game from IO Interactive. Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training programme, and discover an origin story of the world’s most famous spy.","detailedDescription":"The 007 First Light Path Tracing Update is now LIVE!\n\nTogether with NVIDIA, we’re bringing a new level of lighting, reflections and detail to 007 First Light.\n\nWe’ve also updated the PC specs to reflect the Path Tracing update - be sure to check them before jumping in.\n\nDownload the latest update and experience the game in a whole new light!\n\n007 First Light - Reviews!\n\nGet the Deluxe Edition now!\n\nElevate your espionage adventure with 007 First Light Deluxe Edition. Earn your number in style with 4 new outfits, 4 new gadget skins and a new weapon skin.\n\n4 outfits: \n\n• \nDay of the Dead \n\n• \nDesert Explorer \n\n• \nSilent Anchor \n\n• \nGentleman Operator   \n\nWeapon skin: \n\n• \nAgent’s Mark   \n\nGleaming Pack, including 4 gadget skins: \n\n• \nGleaming Lighter \n\n• \nGleaming Earphones \n\n• \nGleaming Phone \n\n• \nGleaming Pen\n\nCheck out the full year one content overview!\n\nLaunch is just the beginning for 007 First Light.  \nYear one  is packed with new Tac Sim missions, Bawma's return, new gadgets, photomode, and more.\n\nAbout the Game\n\nFollow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world’s most famous spy.\n\nAfter a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.","aboutGame":"Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world’s most famous spy.\n\nAfter a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/c5b553fd05ba41aefa6daeddac95849a10c93022/header_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1791886607"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/6833c82f518e5a4d0881152fa9cbf01c5d103924/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1791886607"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/7db21cb760a2570ad873334c3fb1f704.avif?t=1791886607","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/aff3dabd991af439209a43bf0a5cf499.avif?t=1791886607","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/6836e971b215d6695a6f984215bc3063.avif?t=1791886607","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/746c828fbff234da8208a6bcfc112021.avif?t=1791886607","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/ef374e5e4ede8c71f32d455652bc00f2fa7c035e/ss_ef374e5e4ede8c71f32d455652bc00f2fa7c035e.600x338.jpg?t=1791886607","url":"https://shared.akama